dialogs
0	The way the winds blow, volcanic ash is never blown in this direction.The air is clean and delicious here. Living here should do wonders for even frail and sickly people.
1	My papa told me.He says this tunnel is full of timid POKéMON.They get all scared of loud noise and make a big uproar.So they had to stop the big tunnel project.But there's one man. He's trying to dig the tunnel by himself!
2	Did you see the cave next to the POKéMON MART?There's a guy in there who's trying to bust up boulders so he can bust out through to the other side.It'd be great if we could go through… It'll make it easy to visit RUSTBORO.
3	My POKéMON and I, we've been riding a hot winning streak.So I decided to make my BATTLE TENT debut in this town.
